<title>UK: Dixie Toga sets $77 mln eight-year Eurobond, call.</title>
<headline>Dixie Toga sets $77 mln eight-year Eurobond, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Dixie Toga SA has launched a $77 million eight-year Eurobond which will be priced later today, lead manager Indosuez Capital said on Monday. There will be a call and a put option after five years.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
